<title>BELGIUM: U.S. Colt frontrunner to buy Belgian arms maker.</title>
<headline>U.S. Colt frontrunner to buy Belgian arms maker.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. gunmaker Colt emerged on Friday as the frontrunner to acquire Belgian arms maker Herstal SA from French state-controlled defence group GIAT.</p>
<p>Belgium's Walloon Regional Government, which owns an eight percent blocking stake in Herstal, said it discussed a sale with representatives of the U.S. firm on Friday and planned further talks next week.</p>
</text>
